WEBVTT

00:00:18.339 --> 00:00:19.465
Witches.

00:00:20.299 --> 00:00:22.801
MAGICAL EXPOSURE THREAT LEVEL
EMERGENCY

00:00:25.429 --> 00:00:27.681
MAGICAL CONGRESS
OF THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.018
HEINRICH: Our American friends
have permitted a breach

00:00:31.644 --> 00:00:36.065
of the Statute of Secrecy that
threatens to expose us all.

00:00:36.231 --> 00:00:37.650
I will not be lectured by the man

00:00:37.816 --> 00:00:40.027
who let Gellert Grindelwald
slip through his fingers.

00:00:40.194 --> 00:00:44.156
Madam President, I'm sorry to interrupt,
but this is critical...

00:00:57.586 --> 00:00:59.129
SERAPHINA: You better have
an excellent excuse

00:00:59.338 --> 00:01:01.340
for this intrusion, Ms. Goldstein.

00:01:02.132 --> 00:01:04.176
Yes. I do.

00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:08.472
Ma'am,

00:01:08.889 --> 00:01:13.185
yesterday a wizard entered New York
with a case, this case,

00:01:13.394 --> 00:01:14.520
full of magical creatures.

00:01:14.687 --> 00:01:16.689
And unfortunately, some have escaped.

00:01:17.189 --> 00:01:18.732
He arrived yesterday?

00:01:20.359 --> 00:01:22.361
You've known for 24 hours

00:01:22.528 --> 00:01:26.448
that an unregistered wizard
set magical beasts loose in New York,

00:01:26.615 --> 00:01:29.243
and you see fit to tell us
only when a man has been killed?

00:01:31.912 --> 00:01:33.038
Who's been killed?

00:01:33.664 --> 00:01:35.457
Where is this man?

00:02:10.284 --> 00:02:11.285
(GRUNTS)

00:02:11.452 --> 00:02:12.453
(CROWD MURMURING)

00:02:15.789 --> 00:02:16.832
BRITISH ENVOY: Scamander?

00:02:19.877 --> 00:02:20.919
Oh, hello, Minister.

00:02:21.086 --> 00:02:22.212
MOMOLU: Theseus Scamander?

00:02:22.379 --> 00:02:23.589
The war hero?

00:02:23.756 --> 00:02:25.591
No. This is his little brother.

00:02:26.216 --> 00:02:28.260
And what are you doing in New York?

00:02:28.635 --> 00:02:30.429
I came to buy an Appaloosa Puffskein, sir.

00:02:30.596 --> 00:02:31.764
Right.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:33.390
What are you really doing here?

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:36.018
SERAPHINA: Goldstein,

00:02:36.268 --> 00:02:37.394
who is this?

00:02:38.353 --> 00:02:39.897
This is Jacob Kowalski, Madam President.

00:02:40.064 --> 00:02:42.649
He's a No-Maj who got bitten
by one of Mr. Scamander's creatures.

00:02:42.941 --> 00:02:45.110
WITCH: No-Maj? Obliviate him.

00:02:45.527 --> 00:02:46.695
WIZARD: Obliviate him.

00:02:50.449 --> 00:02:51.742
Merlin's beard.

00:02:52.284 --> 00:02:56.121
You know which of your creatures
was responsible, Mr. Scamander?

00:03:01.126 --> 00:03:02.628
No creature did this.

00:03:03.962 --> 00:03:05.339
Don't pretend.

00:03:06.131 --> 00:03:08.008
You must know what that was.
Look at the marks.

00:03:12.888 --> 00:03:14.306
-That was an Obscurus.
-(ALL GASP)

00:03:14.973 --> 00:03:15.974
(CROWD MURMURING)

00:03:17.476 --> 00:03:19.478
SERAPHINA: You go too far, Mr. Scamander.

00:03:20.562 --> 00:03:22.940
There is no Obscurial in America.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.444
Impound that case, Graves.

00:03:28.487 --> 00:03:29.822
-Wait, no. Give that back.
-Arrest them.

00:03:30.656 --> 00:03:31.824
(GRUNTING)

00:03:35.494 --> 00:03:37.121
Don't hurt those creatures.

00:03:37.788 --> 00:03:40.124
Please. You don't understand.
Nothing in there's dangerous.

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.501
-Nothing.
-We'll be the judges of that.

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:44.294
Take them to the cells.

00:03:45.504 --> 00:03:48.549
Don't hurt those creatures.
Nothing in there is dangerous.

00:03:49.049 --> 00:03:51.135
Please don't hurt my creatures.
They aren't dangerous!

00:03:51.426 --> 00:03:53.220
Please! They're not dangerous!

00:03:53.971 --> 00:03:55.347
They're not dangerous!

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.108
I'm so sorry about your creatures,
Mr. Scamander.

00:04:07.025 --> 00:04:08.443
I truly am.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.363
Can someone please tell me

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:14.658
what this Obscurial,
Obscurius thing is, please?

00:04:16.952 --> 00:04:18.996
There hasn't been one for centuries.

00:04:20.706 --> 00:04:23.375
I met one in Sudan three months ago.

00:04:25.377 --> 00:04:28.422
There used to be more of them,
but they still exist.

00:04:31.717 --> 00:04:34.011
It was before wizards went underground,

00:04:35.137 --> 00:04:37.723
when we were still
being hunted by Muggles.

00:04:38.807 --> 00:04:42.477
Young wizards and witches
sometimes tried to suppress their magic

00:04:42.644 --> 00:04:44.229
to avoid persecution.

00:04:45.731 --> 00:04:49.193
So, instead of learning to harness
or to control their powers,

00:04:50.569 --> 00:04:53.572
they developed
what was called an Obscurus.

00:04:56.408 --> 00:04:58.744
It's an unstable,
uncontrollable dark force

00:04:58.911 --> 00:05:00.913
that busts out and attacks.

00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:05.918
And then vanishes.

00:05:09.296 --> 00:05:11.924
Obscurials can't survive long, can they?

00:05:12.257 --> 00:05:16.386
There's no documented case of an Obscurial
surviving past the age of 10.

00:05:18.013 --> 00:05:20.307
The one I met in Africa was 8 when she--

00:05:24.478 --> 00:05:26.730
She was 8 when she died.

00:05:30.275 --> 00:05:31.568
What are you telling me here?

00:05:31.735 --> 00:05:35.530
That Senator Shaw was killed by a kid?

00:05:40.869 --> 00:05:44.456
(SINGING) My momma, your momma
Flying on a switch

00:05:44.623 --> 00:05:48.126
My momma, your momma
Witches never cry

00:05:48.293 --> 00:05:51.546
My momma, your momma
Witches gonna die

00:05:52.172 --> 00:05:55.467
Witch number one, drown in the river

00:05:55.676 --> 00:05:58.303
Witch number two, got a noose...

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:00.305
CHASTITY: Hand out your leaflets.

00:06:01.306 --> 00:06:02.766
I'll know if you dump them.

00:06:03.976 --> 00:06:06.144
Tell me if you see anything suspicious.

